 "structural_finding": {
  "claim": "there is no emulation path, so no per-instruction energy exists for these thirteen",
  "evidence": [
   "device-minion-runtime/src/MachineMinion/src/trap_routine.c: EXCEPTION_ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is emulated only for csrrs mhartid; everything else sets delegate = true and returns stvec",
   "device-minion-runtime/src/WorkerMinion/src/exception.c exception_handler: for a U-mode exception it saves the context, evicts the S-mode and U-mode trace buffers, sends CM_TO_MM_MESSAGE_ID_KERNEL_EXCEPTION once per shire, and calls return_from_kernel(0, KERNEL_RETURN_EXCEPTION)",
   "so one trapping instruction ends that hart's kernel; it never returns to mepc+4"
  ],
  "source": "Apache-2.0, installed on the lab boxes at /opt/et-platform; counted ELFs at /opt/et/lib/esperanto-fw/*/"
 },
